---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import Anim from "../../components/Anim.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="@open-rgs/cascade  - Tumbles"
  description="Cascade: Clear, fall, refill, repeat."
>
  <main>
    <p class="dim"><a href="/extension">&larr; extensions</a></p>
    <h1>@open-rgs/cascade</h1>

    <p class="lede">Clear, fall, refill, repeat.</p>

    <Anim kind="cascade" caption="The loop is bounded. A refill can always win again, so unbounded, one unlucky spin hangs the process; <code>truncated</code> reports when the cap fired." />

    <p>Gravity is per column: a short reel drops a shorter distance, and treating the board as a rectangle produces a shuffle rather than a fall. The multiplier ladder applies to each step's OWN win - applying it to the running total compounds and inflates RTP badly.</p>

    <h2 data-section="&sect;">Reach for</h2>
    <pre><code>{`import { ... } from "@open-rgs/cascade";`}</code></pre>
    <p class="dim">runCascade  &middot;  tumble  &middot;  clear  &middot;  collapse  &middot;  refill  &middot;  multiplierForStep</p>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
